1
00:00:00,939 --> 00:00:05,239
(Raj:)Well, I hope you saved room
for chocolate lava cake.

2
00:00:05,444 --> 00:00:06,654
(Lakshmi:)Impressive.

3
00:00:06,862 --> 00:00:08,942
(Lakshmi:)What goes into making something
like that?

4
00:00:09,156 --> 00:00:11,946
Well, you start out by trying
to make chocolate soufflé.

5
00:00:12,159 --> 00:00:13,659
(Raj:)And when it falls, you panic...

6
00:00:13,869 --> 00:00:16,369
(Raj:)...quickly change the name,
and voilá, lava cake.

7
00:00:17,748 --> 00:00:20,838
l bet our parents are dying to know
how things are going here.

8
00:00:21,043 --> 00:00:23,503
(Raj:)Well, let's see.

9
00:00:24,588 --> 00:00:26,008
Yep, three missed calls.

10
00:00:26,214 --> 00:00:29,134
(Lakshmi:)Four missed calls, two text messages,
and a failed video chat.

11
00:00:29,343 --> 00:00:31,473
- l win.
- Ha, ha.

12
00:00:31,678 --> 00:00:34,218
So, what are we going to tell them?

13
00:00:35,057 --> 00:00:37,977
- l'd like to tell them things are going well.
- Me too.

14
00:00:38,185 --> 00:00:39,815
(Lakshmi:)But before we get their hopes up...

15
00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:42,860
(Lakshmi:)...we should probably make sure
we're on the same page.

16
00:00:43,065 --> 00:00:44,355
(Penny:)Okay.

17
00:00:44,566 --> 00:00:46,856
(Raj:)What page are you on?

18
00:00:47,069 --> 00:00:50,659
I'm on the one where I'm under
a lot of pressure from my parents...

19
00:00:50,864 --> 00:00:53,574
(Lakshmi:)...to get married and settle down
and have a family.

20
00:00:53,784 --> 00:00:57,124
(Lakshmi:)And I'm going to do it
so they don't find out I'm gay.

21
00:00:59,873 --> 00:01:01,333
Say again?

